{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Desert Rug is a piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"]," that can be purchased on ",["l","春季","Spring 17"]," for 25 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s from the ",["l","沙漠节#Calico Egg Merchant","Calico Egg Merchant"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". It may be placed anywhere indoors."]]]],["Note",2,[["p",["The Desert Rug is one of only four rugs that cannot be purchased via the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"],", ",["l","Joja家具目录","Joja Furniture Catalogue"],", ",["l","法师目录","Wizard Catalogue"],", ",["l","祝尼魔目录","Junimo Catalogue"],", or ",["l","复古目录","Retro Catalogue"],". The other three are the ",["l","水果沙拉地毯","Fruit Salad Rug"],", the ",["l","海盗地毯","Pirate Rug"],", and the ",["l","沙子地毯","Sandy Rug"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}